  "message":
  "Try these:\n  [apply] grind only [Fact.out, Nat.prime_two, Nat.prime_dvd_prime_iff_eq, !Finite.one_lt_card_iff_nontrivial,\n    = Set.mem_insert_iff, = Set.mem_singleton_iff, #e2d4, #9188, #c82c, #e355, #c761]\n  [apply] grind only [Fact.out, Nat.prime_two, Nat.prime_dvd_prime_iff_eq, !Finite.one_lt_card_iff_nontrivial,\n    = Set.mem_insert_iff, = Set.mem_singleton_iff]\n  [apply] grind =>\n    instantiate only [Fact.out, Nat.prime_two, Nat.prime_dvd_prime_iff_eq, !Finite.one_lt_card_iff_nontrivial]\n    cases #e2d4 <;>\n      cases #9188 <;>\n        instantiate only [= Set.mem_insert_iff] <;>\n          instantiate only [= Set.mem_singleton_iff] <;> cases #c82c <;> cases #e355 <;> cases #c761",
  "goalIsProp": true,
  "filepath":
